{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51420","headline":"还故居 · 江全铭","name":"还故居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"路入丰溪上，超然绝世氛。\n懒寻书作伴，长与鹤爲羣。\n千虑净如水，一身闲似云。\n梅花领幽赏，疎雪隔帘分。\n（嘉庆《旌德县志》七《选举》及十九《艺文》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"江全铭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51420.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51420","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}